An additional short, How to Hook Up Your Home Theater, was released in 2007.

7
00:04:54,000 --> 00:05:00,000
The series stars the titular character Goofy, introduced in the short
film series Mickey Mouse as one of Mickey's friends.

8
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:42,000
The film explores themes of magic, look-alike,
cartoon cat, cartoon mouse, hypnotism.

9
